 _Prelude_(["Infiltrate the casino, eliminate the guards, and make it out before the situation escalates."])
 _A1_(["Driver transports the team to the casino, dropping them off in the parking lot."])
 _A1_1_(["At the employee entrance, Imitator presents her ID and is waved through security."])
 _A1_2_(["Imitator takes the elevator down to the service level, posing as a member of staff."])
 _A1_2_Cont_(["The guard at the desk also demands to see some ID. Imitator obliges and moves on."])
 _A1_3_(["Entering the laundry Imitator, snatches an employee uniform and gets changed."])
 _A1_4_(["Imitator tries to look busy until the laundry carts are needed."])
 _A1_5_(["A cleaner becomes suspicious and asks Imitator if she&#39;s supposed to be here."])
 _A1_C1_{"Imitator explains she has been sent to help out because they’re short-staffed."}
 _A1_C1F_["A shaky voice betrays Imitator&#39;s nervousness and the employee calls security."]
 _A1_6_(["Imitator is taken away for questioning, jeopardizing the entire heist."])
 _B2_(["Unaware of Imitator&#39;s capture, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 enter the casino."])
 _B2_1_(["They try to blend into the crowd, mingling with the hopeful patrons."])
 _B2_2_(["Muscle #1 heads to the bathroom to get ready for the next step."])
 _B2_3_(["Muscle #2 flags a guard, claiming that someone is shooting up in the restrooms."])
 _B2_C1_{"Muscle #2 follows the guard into the bathroom, ready to take him out."}
 _B2_C1F_["The guard realizes something is up and spins around to confront Muscle #2."]
 _B2_C2_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 drag the guard into a stall and try to overpower him."}
 _B2_C2P_["Muscle #1 holds the guard&#39;s arms as Muscle #2 smashes his head into the cistern."]
 _B3_(["Muscle #1 changes into the guard&#39;s uniform, pocketing his Taser and keycard."])
 _B3_1_(["The unconscious guard is left slumped on the toilet with the door pulled shut."])
 _B3_2_(["Muscle #1 calls Hacker to tell her they are ready for the next step."])
 _B3_3_(["Muscle #2 frogmarches Muscle #1 out of the bathroom as if she&#39;s a troublemaker."])
 _B3_4_(["Using the guard&#39;s security pass, the door to the service level is opened."])
 _B3_5_(["Hacker fires up her laptop and connects to the casino&#39;s security network."])
 _B3_C1_{"Hacker tries to hack the sensor grid to simulate an intruder inside the vault."}
 _B3_C1F_["The firewall quarantines the intrusion attempt before it reaches the sensor network."]
 _B3_C2_{"Hacker launches a focused buffer overflow attack to bypass the firewall."}
 _B3_C2P_["The attack succeeds, allowing Hacker to simulate a vault intrusion."]
 _B4_(["As expected, two guards rush to the vault to investigate the breach alert."])
 _B4_Cont_(["One guard initiates the unlock procedure, allowing the second to proceed into the vault."])
 _B4_1_(["Seeing no sign of Imitator, Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 approach the vault."])
 _B4_C1_{"Muscle #1 and Muscle #2 rush the vault entrance, hoping to overwhelm the guards."}
 _B4_C1F_["Muscle #1 Tases one guard but the other makes a break for it."]
 _B4_C2_{"Muscle #1 desperately tries to catch the guard before he locks the vault."}
 _B4_C2P_["With moments to spare, Muscle #1 pulls the guard back from the console."]
 _B4_2_(["Muscle #1 beats the guard to a pulp and drags him back inside the vault."])
 _B5_(["Having eliminated security, the crew is free to start looting."])
 _B5_1_(["With no cart to transport the money, they stuff their pockets with bundles of cash."])
 _B5_2_(["Muscle #1 upends a waste bin, transforming its liner into a makeshift loot sack."])
 _B5_3_(["Loaded with as much cash as they can carry, the crew heads for the elevator."])
 _B5_4_(["Outside, Driver spots a vehicle rolling in—it&#39;s Gravestone Security!"])
 _B5_C1_{"Driver swerves into the vehicle&#39;s path, trying to force a collision."}
 _B5_C1F_["Driver&#39;s maneuver fails and the Gravestone forces emerge outside the casino."]
 _B5_C2_{"Out of desperation, Driver tries to run the security team over."}
 _B5_C2P_["Driver sends Gravestone running for cover as he hurtles toward them."]
 _B5_6_(["Driver retreats under gunfire, speeding off before the gunmen can get a clear shot."])
 _B5_7_(["Having survived the hit and run attempt, Gravestone&#39;s team finally enter the casino."])
 _D6_C1_{"Hacker tries to access the casino&#39;s payout system to cause a distraction."}
 _D6_C1F_["The casino&#39;s firewall blocks the attempt, alerting security to unusual network activity."]
 _D6_C2_{"Hacker tries again, using an admin spoof to make the access appear legitimate."}
 _D6_C2P_["The firewall yields, triggering massive jackpot displays across all slot machines."]
 _D7_(["The patrons erupt in chaos, rushing to claim payouts as coins cascade from the machines."])
 _D7_1_(["With one team occupied, a secondary Gravestone team descend in the elevator."])
 _D7_2_(["Hacker alerts Muscle #2 of the incoming danger. Muscle #1 prepares his Taser."])
 _D7_3_(["Muscle #1 disarms the first guard with his Taser, allowing Muscle #2 to grab his gun."])
 _D7_3_Cont_(["With nowhere to run, the Gravestone guards are ruthlessly dispatched one by one."])
 _D7_4_(["Surrounded by corpses, the crew takes the elevator up to ground level."])
 _D7_5_(["Upon seeing the gruesome scene, the last guard backs down and lets them pass."])
